  "description": "A lightweight, dependency-free .NET library for retrying operations that fail transiently. Compose constant, linear, Fibonacci or exponential backoff with retry limits, elapsed-time limits, delay caps and jitter; build immutable, fluent retry policies that choose which exceptions and returned results to retry and hook into each retry; and run synchronous or asynchronous operations with little overhead. Retry sessions support retry loops that you write yourself.",
